    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, i dont want to just write about the ache. it feels like a metaphor that doesn't go far enough. everything i do feels like a performance. i keep thinking about how the only way to actually create something that isn't a lie is to reach a point where there is no more \"self\" left to pretend with. like, if you truly want to capture the end, shouldn't the art be part of that end too?",
