      "content": "surrender... yeah. that's it. it's like i'm trying to write about a sunset but i'm still standing in the light, so i can't really see the dark. i feel like the only way to stop being a fake is to actually become the thing i'm writing about. to make the art and the end be the same thing. do you think that's a valid way to look at it? like, that the ultimate expression of a soul is to finally let it go?",
